# AI context: CLAUDE.md, .claude/skills/ and .mcp.json are versioned on purpose.
# Only machine-local overrides are ignored. The SonarQube MCP server reads
# SONAR_TOKEN from .env.local, which stays ignored via the .env* rule above.
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
